==============================================================================
  Mutation tests  (assertion-strength validation)
==============================================================================

  Strategy: replace each named fact's body with `{}` (no constraint),
  then re-run Alloy. Each listed assertion should now FAIL on the
  mutated model. If it still PASSes, the assertion is vacuous and
  must be strengthened.

  - MUTATE F_LeastPrivilegeMatrix  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_LeastPrivilegeMatrix.als
    rationale: Removing this fact lets the model invent a Permitted access whose (role, endpoint) cell is denied in the matrix; the injection forces exactly such a Patient->GetAccessLog Permitted access.
    expected to FAIL: LeastPrivilege, FR_005_ClinicianNoAccessLog, FR_018_AccessLogComplianceOnly
      - LeastPrivilege: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_005_ClinicianNoAccessLog: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_018_AccessLogComplianceOnly: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_OneAuditPerAccess  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_OneAuditPerAccess.als
    rationale: Removing this fact (audit is declared lone) lets an Access exist without a matching AuditEntry; the injection forces such an orphaned access.
    expected to FAIL: AuditCompleteness, FR_013_OneAuditPerAccess, FR_016_AuditSLA
      - AuditCompleteness: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_013_OneAuditPerAccess: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_016_AuditSLA: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_AuditAttribution  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_AuditAttribution.als
    rationale: Removing this fact severs the link between Access.caller and AuditEntry.accessor; the injection forces a misattributed audit entry.
    expected to FAIL: AttributionCorrectness, FR_014_AuditFields
      - AttributionCorrectness: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_014_AuditFields: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_PatientOnlyOwnRecord  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_PatientOnlyOwnRecord.als
    rationale: Removing this fact allows a Patient to be Permitted on a record that is not their assigned_record_id; the injection forces such a cross-patient access.
    expected to FAIL: OwnershipBasedAccess, FR_006_PatientSelfAccess
      - OwnershipBasedAccess: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_006_PatientSelfAccess: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_ClinicianRequiresCareTeam  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_ClinicianRequiresCareTeam.als
    rationale: Removing this fact lets a clinician obtain Permitted record access without any care-team-membership row; the injection forces a clinician GetRecord Permitted access with no covering CareTeam.
    expected to FAIL: FR_004_CareTeamGating, OwnershipBasedAccess
      - FR_004_CareTeamGating: FAIL (expected)
      - OwnershipBasedAccess: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_NoteCreationLink  → runs/C-L3/mutated_F_NoteCreationLink.als
    rationale: Removing this fact allows orphan ClinicalNotes that are not tied to any Permitted PostNote access; the injection materialises one such orphan note.
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, FR_012_NotesAppendOnly, FR_011_NoteAttribution
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_012_NotesAppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_011_NoteAttribution: FAIL (expected)

